message: >
  If you use this software, please cite the repository and the given paper under "references".
  This project has been developed with the help of many contributors.
  A list of contributors can be found in "CONTRIBUTORS.md".
  If you use specific methods implemented in this repository, please also cite
  the corresponding method papers listed in the "Citing PICLas" section of the README.md file.

